# The root .gitignore's blanket "*.md" rule is anchored to repo-root docs/, not this module's own; keep this
# module's docs tracked too (see docs/SETTINGS.md, generated from SettingCatalog and checked by SettingsDocTest).
!docs/
!docs/*.md
!docs/**/*.md
